Suppose that $AD$ and $BC$ intersect at $E$.

[asy]
pair A,B,C,D,I;
A=(-9,-4.36);
B=(-7,7.14);
C=(8,-6);
D=(7.5,6.61);
I=(2.7,3);
draw(Circle((0,0),10));
draw(A--B--C--cycle,linewidth(0.7));
draw(B--D--C);
draw(A--D);
label("$E$",I,S);
label("$B$",B,N);
label("$D$",D,NE);
label("$C$",C,E);
label("$A$",A,SW);
[/asy]

